The '''water horse spell''' is a water-type [[Spells|spell]] that creates a horse made from water.

==Description==
The spell consists of a central water sigil, with a horse-like sign located above it. An unknown signs is located to the left and right of the sigil, and an alternating collection of directional and line-shaped signs are situated below the sigil. The spell creates a horse made from water, which can be used to pull a vehicle, such as in the case of the [[Water Horse Carriage|water horse carriage]].

==Usage==
The spell was used by [[Qifrey]] to pull a water horse carriage which he and [[Qifrey's Atelier|his apprentices]] used to travel to the [[Silver Eve]].

